cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below."
title: "PawMultiverse pet food recall record"
abstract: >-
  A cross-border record of pet food recalls, built by reading five official government
  registers on a schedule and keeping every entry after the publishing authority takes
  it down. Covers France (RappelConso), the United States (FDA animal and veterinary
  recalls, and pet food enforcement reports), the United Kingdom (Food Standards Agency)
  and Canada. Matches products across registers on barcode, so the same product recalled
  in more than one country can be seen in one place, and keeps every dated version of a
  notice so changes an authority made after publishing remain visible.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "A.I.T. Multiverse Consulting Ltd"
    city: Nicosia
    country: CY
    website: "https://aitmultiverse.com/"
